# ---- Reverse-engineering inputs: NOT PART OF THIS PROJECT ---------------
# These directories hold the *vendor's* closed-source artifacts that were
# inspected during the reverse-engineering work:
#
#   extracted/       the shipped Electron ASAR, its extracted JS, package.json
#   src/             the vendor's JavaScript modules extracted from that ASAR
#   minitela-backup/ the packaged UI bundle (data.json, resources, Texture.acf,
#                    file.zip, icons, backgrounds, the Windows ACF inputs, ...)
#
# They are deliberately NOT committed: this repository ships only original
# code and original documentation, and never redistributes vendor material.
# The documentation references those files by name so that a reader who has
# their own copy of the vendor package can reproduce the analysis.
extracted/
minitela-backup/
src/
